{"articleNo":"456793","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=456793&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2023년 교원해외파견사업 장기파견자 2차 선발 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.08.09","hit":"2878","attachments":[{"name":"(국립국제교육원 공고 제2023-122호) 2023년 교원해외파견사업 2차 선발 공고문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=456793&attachNo=126208"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:210%;margin-top:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:15.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:15.0pt;\">국립국제교육원은 우수 교원</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:15.0pt;\">에게 해외교육봉사활동 기회를 제공함으로써 교육원조 국가로서의 성과를 제고하고 </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">교원의 글로벌 교육역량 강화 및 선진화된 교수 방법 제공 등을 통하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:15.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:0.2pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">개발도상국의 기초교육향상을 지원하기 위한 </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:15.0pt;\">｢</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:15.0pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:0.2pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:15.0pt;\">년 교원해외파견</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:0.4pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:15.0pt;\">사</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:0.2pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:15.0pt;\">업</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:15.0pt;\">｣</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:0.2pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">에 참여할 대상자를 아래와 같이 공개 모집하니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:0.2pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">해외봉사에 열</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:15.0pt;\">정이 가득한 참신하고 능력 있는 분들의 많은 지원을 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:15.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:140%;margin-left:47.3pt;text-indent:-47.3pt;margin-top:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:HY헤드라인M;mso-fareast-font-family:HY헤드라인M;font-size:15.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:140%;margin-left:47.3pt;text-indent:-47.3pt;margin-top:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:HY헤드라인M;mso-fareast-font-family:HY헤드라인M;font-size:15.0pt;\">지원 방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;margin-left:32.4pt;text-indent:-32.4pt;margin-top:3.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-far