ise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:13.0pt;\">까지 국립국제교육원 도착분에 한하여 접수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:32.4pt;text-indent:-32.4pt;margin-top:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-ascii-font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\">제출 서류: 첨부 공고문 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-left:35.8pt;text-indent:-35.8pt;margin-top:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-ascii-font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\">제출 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-ascii-font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:15.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:HY울릉도M;mso-fareast-font-family:HY울릉도M;font-size:15.0pt;\">등기우편 또는 방문</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:35.8pt;text-indent:-35.8pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:15.0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:210%;margin-top:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-p